county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids March to April came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, January to February sat at 22% of normal on the middle of the grids, and May to June at 57%. So far in 2026, June to July is at 78% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 33435 had its driest year in 1976 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
